-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Written by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illustration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illustrated by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">February 22, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Chronology</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_28\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 28\">Something Is Killing the Children #28</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_30\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 30\">Something Is Killing the Children #30</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #29</b> is a horror comic from <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> that was published on February 22, 2023 by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>. It is the twenty-ninth issue in the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<p>It's the final hour for <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica</a> as she has no choice left but to face the Duplicitype and save Tribulation from its reckoning. But Cutter's looming arrival isn't the only thing competing for the rogue Black Mask's attention. Gabi has her own plans–ones that put her in grave danger.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gabi_Lopez\" title=\"Gabi Lopez\">Gabi Lopez</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"67b7a1103a9051e60fdeda7364602f1a\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_29_Cover-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:120px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Something_Is_Killi